window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A missing king, a missing princess, and a missing dragon</p> <p>The world of Umbra Mundus is in shambles. Magick is quickly fading and the clock is ticking. A battle between dark and light is quickly approaching, and the lost princess is their only hope.</p> <p>When eighteen-year-old Alys begins to suffer a string of unfortunate events after her birthday, she soon discovers the mysterious man watching her from afar is responsible for it all. Her seemingly normal life soon makes a dramatic change, suddenly finding herself in a terrifying yet fantastical world. Lovers turn to enemies, foes disguised as friends, and hidden secrets lurk behind every corner. After discovering her true identity, she is forced into a position never asked for, the fate of the entire realm now in her hands.</p> <p><i>The Chosen</i> is a darker fantasy with a contemp twist, full of mythical creatures, magick, romance, and heartbreak.</p>"; 
